   "html": "<p>Coming off the success of our stunt in San Diego, we spearheaded an exclusive screening the week after in NYC for tastemakers and cultural influencers. </p>\n<p>We transformed the AMC Lincoln Square into an apocalyptic casino reminiscent of Sweet Tooth’s Lair. Upon arrival, guests were greeted by Sweet Tooth’s ice cream truck, set among more apocalyptic decor and set pieces, which served as a must-have photo backdrop even in the rain. </p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "SWEET TOOTH'S LAIR",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Once inside, guests were transported into Lost Vegas, Sweet Tooth’s playground, complete with slot machines, mood lighting and carpet. Costumes of the eight key characters were also on display. </p>"
