   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Inside the theater, BAs handed out branded Von Dutch trucker hats while Pictureplane DJ'd 90’s and 00’s hits. Comedian, Evan Williams, introduced the film along with a special video from Anthony Mackie before the first 2 episodes were premiered. The Cobrasnake roamed the venue capturing guests throughout the evening.</p>"
